#: .\templates\base.html:156
msgid "首頁"
msgstr "Home"

#: .\templates\base.html:160
msgid "地點"
msgstr "Places"

#: .\templates\base.html:164
msgid "回憶"
msgstr "Memories"

#: .\templates\base.html:168
msgid "探索"
msgstr "Explore"

#: .\templates\base.html:172
msgid "個人資料"
msgstr "Profile"

#: .\templates\base.html:178
msgid "登出"
msgstr "Logout"

#: .\templates\base.html:185
msgid "登入"
msgstr "Login"

#: .\templates\home.html:218
msgid "Keep places. Keep memories."
msgstr "Keep places. Keep memories."

#: .\templates\home.html:221
msgid ""
" WhereNow 是一個用來記錄地點、建立回憶、整理收藏，\n"
"    並支援情侶共享生活紀錄的 Web 系統。 "
msgstr ""
"WhereNow is a web system for recording places, creating memories, organizing "
"favorites, and supporting shared life records for couples."

#: .\templates\home.html:227
msgid "開始探索"
msgstr "Start Exploring"

#: .\templates\home.html:231
msgid "查看個人資料"
msgstr "View Profile"

#: .\templates\home.html:236
msgid "探索公開內容"
msgstr "Explore Public Content"

#: .\templates\home.html:239
msgid ""
" 你可以依照關鍵字、分類、地區與預算，\n"
"      探索別人公開分享的地點與回憶。 "
msgstr ""
"You can explore public places and memories shared by others by keyword, "
"category, area, and budget."

#: .\templates\home.html:245
msgid "關鍵字"
msgstr "Keyword"

#: .\templates\home.html:252
msgid "例如：淡水、咖啡廳、約會、台北"
msgstr "Example: Tamsui, cafe, date, Taipei"

#: .\templates\home.html:257
msgid "分類"
msgstr "Category"

#: .\templates\home.html:260
msgid "不限"
msgstr "Any"

#: .\templates\home.html:269
msgid "地區"
msgstr "Area"

#: .\templates\home.html:276
msgid "例如：台北、淡水"
msgstr "Example: Taipei, Tamsui"

#: .\templates\home.html:281
msgid "最低預算"
msgstr "Minimum Budget"

#: .\templates\home.html:293
msgid "最高預算"
msgstr "Maximum Budget"

#: .\templates\home.html:305
msgid "搜尋"
msgstr "Search"

#: .\templates\home.html:307
msgid "清除"
msgstr "Clear"

#: .\templates\home.html:316
msgid "搜尋分類"
msgstr "Search category"

#: .\templates\explore.html:10
msgid "探索內容"
msgstr "Explore Content"

#: .\templates\explore.html:13
msgid "這裡會同時顯示公開內容、你的私人內容，以及伴侶與你共享的內容。"
msgstr ""
"This page shows public content, your private content, and content shared "
"with your partner."

#: .\templates\explore.html:22
msgid "地點名稱、心得、使用者"
msgstr "Place name, review, user"

#: .\templates\explore.html:40
msgid "例如：台中、淡水"
msgstr "Example: Taichung, Tamsui"

#: .\templates\explore.html:56
msgid "套用篩選"
msgstr "Apply Filter"

#: .\templates\explore.html:57
msgid "清除條件"
msgstr "Clear Filter"

#: .\templates\explore.html:72
msgid "沒有圖片"
msgstr "No Image"

#: .\templates\explore.html:92
msgid "查看內容"
msgstr "View Content"

#: .\templates\explore.html:101
msgid "沒有找到符合條件的內容"
msgstr "No matching content found"

#: .\templates\explore.html:103
msgid "你可以試著調整關鍵字、地區或預算條件再搜尋一次。"
msgstr ""
"Try adjusting the keyword, area, or budget and search again."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:12
msgid "共享回憶列表"
msgstr "Shared Memories"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"              查看你和 %(partner_name)s 彼此共享的回憶內容。\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"              View memories shared between you and %(partner_name)s.\n"
"            "

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:19
msgid "我的回憶列表"
msgstr "My Memories"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:21
msgid ""
"把每一次約會、旅行、日常片段與重要時刻收藏起來，讓回憶不只是被記住，而是能被重新打開與回看。"
msgstr ""
"Save every date, trip, daily moment, and important memory so they can "
"always be revisited."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:27
msgid "新增回憶"
msgstr "Add Memory"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"          你目前正在查看與 %(partner_name)s 的共享回憶清單。\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          You are viewing shared memories with %(partner_name)s.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:38
msgid "你目前沒有情侶關係，這裡是你的個人回憶清單。"
msgstr ""
"You currently do not have a couple relationship. This is your personal "
"memory list."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:55
msgid "沒有照片"
msgstr "No Photo"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:78
msgid "建立者"
msgstr "Created By"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:81
msgid "我"
msgstr "Me"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:94
msgid "花費"
msgstr "Cost"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:99
msgid "未填寫"
msgstr "Not Provided"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:105
msgid "是否公開"
msgstr "Public"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:106
msgid "是,否"
msgstr "Yes,No"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:114
msgid "這筆回憶尚未填寫心得。"
msgstr "No comment has been added for this memory yet."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:120
msgid "與情侶共享"
msgstr "Shared with Partner"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:124
msgid "推薦"
msgstr "Recommended"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:129
msgid "查看回憶內容"
msgstr "View Memory"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:138
msgid "目前還沒有任何回憶"
msgstr "No memories yet"

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:139
msgid "先新增第一筆回憶，替你們的重要時刻留下紀錄。"
msgstr "Add your first memory to save your important moments."

#: .\templates\memories\memory_list.html:140
msgid "新增第一筆回憶"
msgstr "Add First Memory"

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:17
msgid "共享地點列表"
msgstr "Shared Places"

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:19
msgid "我的地點列表"
msgstr "My Places"

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:25
#, python-format
