"\n"
"          你目前正在查看 %(partner_name)s 與你共享的地點。\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          You are viewing places shared with you by %(partner_name)s.\n"
"        "

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:29
msgid "這裡是你建立的地點清單，可以管理、查看與記錄你的生活足跡。"
msgstr ""
"This is your place list where you can manage and record your life journey."

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:35
msgid "新增地點"
msgstr "Add Place"

