msgstr "No places yet"

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:114
msgid "當你或伴侶有勾選共享地點後，這裡會顯示。"
msgstr ""
"Shared places will appear here after you or your partner enable sharing."

#: .\templates\places\place_list.html:116
msgid "先新增一個地點開始吧！"
msgstr "Add your first place to get started."

